1
00:01:55,540 --> 00:01:55,900
Dad.

2
00:01:56,379 --> 00:01:57,500
Your disguise skills

3
00:01:57,799 --> 00:01:58,739
can only fool my mom.

4
00:01:59,959 --> 00:02:01,200
Can you keep your voice down?

5
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:03,260
I don't have a choice here.

6
00:02:03,700 --> 00:02:04,400
It's just a stopgap measure.

7
00:02:05,239 --> 00:02:06,019
Just wait a while longer.

8
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,359
Wait a while longer?

9
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:08,719
If we wait any longer,

10
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:10,400
you two will really get divorced.

11
00:02:10,759 --> 00:02:12,240
You snuck all the way over here

12
00:02:12,620 --> 00:02:13,099
just to see if I've got

13
00:02:13,099 --> 00:02:13,840
any spending money?

14
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,800
That's not like you at all.

15
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,259
Don't you always say

16
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:18,439
you and Mom are true love?

17
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,319
And I was just an accident.

18
00:02:20,819 --> 00:02:21,400
You little brat.

19
00:02:22,819 --> 00:02:23,879
Dad just missed you both.

20
00:02:24,939 --> 00:02:25,500
Missed us?

21
00:02:26,099 --> 00:02:27,400
So much you didn't even dare to call?

22
00:02:28,139 --> 00:02:28,539
Divorce.

23
00:02:28,819 --> 00:02:29,520
Absolutely, we're divorcing.

24
00:02:29,860 --> 00:02:31,340
She yelled loud enough to blow the roof off.

25
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,080
But I got up to pee in the night

26
00:02:34,599 --> 00:02:37,199
and thought I heard Mom crying.

27
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:40,740
Crying like an ice cube melting.

28
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,879
Sniffling on and off.

29
00:02:45,020 --> 00:02:45,979
Your mom was crying?

30
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:46,699
Really.

31
00:02:47,719 --> 00:02:48,719
Why would I lie to you?

32
00:02:49,319 --> 00:02:50,020
So, Dad,

33
00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:51,699
what are you really thinking?

34
00:02:52,180 --> 00:02:52,740
Do you really want the divorce?

35
00:02:53,740 --> 00:02:55,379
Divorce is fine, more peace and quiet.

36
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:57,759
I'll stay with Mom anyway,

37
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:59,159
just send the money on time.

38
00:02:59,819 --> 00:03:02,080
But if I call someone else Dad someday,

39
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,599
don't you go feeling all bitter about it.

40
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,060
Bullshit. Who would dare?

41
00:03:05,180 --> 00:03:05,740
You little brat.

42
00:03:05,900 --> 00:03:07,020
If you dare call anyone else Dad...

43
00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,180
Qian Zhenqing!

44
00:03:10,439 --> 00:03:11,780
No wonder you run off every single day.

45
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:13,199
So you've been meeting up with this

46
00:03:13,400 --> 00:03:14,680
shameless father of yours!

47
00:03:15,319 --> 00:03:15,979
Keep your voice down.

48
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,340
You piece of trash.

49
00:03:17,360 --> 00:03:18,860
Did the dogs eat your conscience?

50
00:03:18,900 --> 00:03:20,159
You've got the nerve to come back?

51
00:03:20,419 --> 00:03:21,939
Stop, don't fight, don't fight.

52
00:03:22,099 --> 00:03:23,139
I've got something to tell you.

53
00:03:23,139 --> 00:03:24,300
Can you just calm down?

54
00:03:24,340 --> 00:03:25,360
Calm down, my ass.

55
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,139
Just hear me out.

56
00:03:26,580 --> 00:03:27,539
I... You're not allowed to talk.

57
00:03:28,099 --> 00:03:29,379
Who says you get to speak whenever you want?

58
00:03:29,819 --> 00:03:31,979
I'm not done, so you keep your mouth shut.

59
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:33,400
Can we talk this out nicely?

60
00:03:48,699 --> 00:03:49,759
You came all the way out here

61
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,080
just to divorce me?

62
00:03:54,379 --> 00:03:55,219
Let me explain

63
00:03:55,819 --> 00:03:56,939
I've got my own plan

64
00:03:57,620 --> 00:03:58,580
Here's what I'm thinking

65
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,939
Let's take care of this first

66
00:04:00,659 --> 00:04:01,460
Bullshit

67
00:04:03,419 --> 00:04:05,080
You don't get to decide on the divorce

68
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:06,740
It's me, Fan Mei,

69
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:08,439
who's divorcing you, Qian Dewang

70
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,020
Qian Zhenqing

71
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:16,339
Dad

72
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:17,560
Your beard's coming off

73
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:19,439
Coming

74
00:04:30,740 --> 00:04:32,360
One of these days, we'll go

75
00:04:32,360 --> 00:04:34,060
and get that divorce finalized.

76
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:35,120
No more dragging it out.

77
00:04:35,519 --> 00:04:36,500
You'll get what you wanted.

78
00:04:36,879 --> 00:04:37,459
What are you looking at?

79
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,139
Get lost.

80
00:04:40,079 --> 00:04:40,959
Qian Zhenqing.

81
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,759
No wonder you've been

82
00:04:42,980 --> 00:04:43,860
always running off lately.

83
00:04:44,060 --> 00:04:46,019
You knew your dad was back all along

84
00:04:46,620 --> 00:04:47,339
and hid it from me, huh?

85
00:04:53,079 --> 00:04:55,379
I'm sorry, okay?

86
00:04:55,759 --> 00:04:57,839
I didn't hide it from you on purpose.

87
00:04:58,079 --> 00:04:59,600
I told you last time,

88
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:00,680
I saw my dad.

89
00:05:01,060 --> 00:05:02,120
You didn't believe me!

90
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,360
Smells like a traitor.

91
00:05:08,579 --> 00:05:09,439
The way I see it, you and your dad

92
00:05:09,459 --> 00:05:10,720
are cut from the same cloth

93
00:05:11,060 --> 00:05:12,040
when it comes to having no conscience.

94
00:05:13,319 --> 00:05:13,879
Be honest.

95
00:05:14,879 --> 00:05:15,500
Are you two

96
00:05:16,180 --> 00:05:17,139
trying to team up

97
00:05:17,139 --> 00:05:17,639
against me?

98
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,500
Team up? Please.

99
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:23,959
He's my soon-to-be-ex-dad,

100
00:05:25,079 --> 00:05:27,279
and you're my real mom.

101
00:05:28,139 --> 00:05:30,100
Am I the type to play favorites?

102
00:05:31,959 --> 00:05:32,920
Cut the sweet talk.

103
00:05:33,759 --> 00:05:35,300
One popsicle and you're bought off.

104
00:05:37,199 --> 00:05:37,800
Did you two

105
00:05:37,819 --> 00:05:38,800
cut some kind of deal?

106
00:05:39,220 --> 00:05:40,319
He sent you here as his persuader?

107
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:42,399
Mom.

108
00:05:42,699 --> 00:05:44,660
You overestimate my dad's guts

109
00:05:45,199 --> 00:05:46,800
and underestimate my loyalty.

110
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,459
Besides,

111
00:05:49,079 --> 00:05:50,199
according to my dad,

112
00:05:50,519 --> 00:05:53,259
he fought a dog to sleep in its bed last night.

113
00:05:53,939 --> 00:05:54,980
And that popsicle,

114
00:05:55,139 --> 00:05:56,899
I gave it to him out of pity.

115
00:06:01,339 --> 00:06:02,180
Don't fall for his tricks.

116
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,779
He's just playing the pity card

117
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,620
to make you his persuader.

118
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:08,519
Persuader? No way.

119
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,600
I'm not doing that.

120
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,959
This tug-of-war between you two

121
00:06:12,540 --> 00:06:14,100
is slower than the old men's chess games.

122
00:06:15,199 --> 00:06:16,800
Whichever side I pick, I'm cannon fodder.

123
00:06:17,439 --> 00:06:18,680
Better to lie flat and just watch.

124
00:06:32,540 --> 00:06:33,459
My dad's probably

125
00:06:33,459 --> 00:06:34,519
still sleeping in the doghouse right now

126
00:06:35,399 --> 00:06:37,120
Once you send that divorce message

127
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,220
for him

128
00:06:38,319 --> 00:06:39,959
it'll be an absolute fatal blow

129
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:43,279
If you really want a divorce, send it now

130
00:06:43,959 --> 00:06:44,879
Don't hesitate

131
00:06:45,319 --> 00:06:45,839
I'm out of here.

132
00:06:46,779 --> 00:06:47,399
Where are you going?

133
00:06:47,959 --> 00:06:48,779
The weather forecast said

134
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:50,300
this area's a thunderstorm zone tonight

135
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,680
I've gotta hurry over to my sister's place

136
00:06:51,699 --> 00:06:52,300
to lie low for a while

137
00:06:53,139 --> 00:06:53,560
I'm off

138
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:55,480
Qian Zhenqing

139
00:06:57,339 --> 00:06:57,759
Get back here

140
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:02,199
Little rascal

141
00:07:29,420 --> 00:07:30,939
Sis, I can't sleep either.

142
00:07:32,319 --> 00:07:32,879
I got yelled at.

143
00:07:35,620 --> 00:07:36,540
My mom insists

144
00:07:36,540 --> 00:07:37,860
that I'm my dad's spy.

145
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,800
I'm nobody's spy.

146
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:43,199
I just wish

147
00:07:43,959 --> 00:07:45,300
neither of them would leave me.

148
00:07:51,860 --> 00:07:53,720
Even the little troublemaker got emotional.

149
00:07:59,220 --> 00:08:00,819
This doll's been sitting in the room

150
00:08:00,819 --> 00:08:02,379
for such a long time now,

151
00:08:02,759 --> 00:08:03,899
it's picked up an herbal scent.

152
00:08:03,939 --> 00:08:04,740
Actually smells pretty nice.

153
00:08:06,980 --> 00:08:07,560
You like it?

154
00:08:08,259 --> 00:08:08,779
Yeah, I do.

155
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:12,339
But everyone says it's ugly,

156
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:13,660
not a good doll.

157
00:08:14,620 --> 00:08:16,060
It doesn't need to be a good doll.

158
00:08:16,980 --> 00:08:18,459
Because it's one of a kind.

159
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,160
And so are you.

160
00:08:24,019 --> 00:08:25,819
Pinch, pinch, I'll pinch you to death!

161
00:08:26,019 --> 00:08:27,779
Counter, counter, shield up!

162
00:08:27,819 --> 00:08:28,399
Shield!

163
00:08:33,899 --> 00:08:34,360
Xiaofang.

164
00:08:34,940 --> 00:08:35,720
Off to gather herbs, huh?

165
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:37,600
What bad timing.

166
00:08:37,620 --> 00:08:38,379
I came all this way

167
00:08:38,379 --> 00:08:39,480
just to thank you.

168
00:08:40,399 --> 00:08:41,159
Bad timing, is it?

169
00:08:41,379 --> 00:08:42,679
Looks to me like your timing's perfect.

170
00:08:43,620 --> 00:08:45,120
Must be fate between us, then.

171
00:08:45,419 --> 00:08:45,700
Here.

172
00:08:46,259 --> 00:08:47,279
Pure wild honey.

173
00:08:47,519 --> 00:08:48,440
The fruit of my revenge.

174
00:08:49,539 --> 00:08:50,299
The fruit of your revenge?

175
00:08:50,299 --> 00:08:50,879
Keep it for yourself.

176
00:08:52,419 --> 00:08:53,019
Xiaofang.

177
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:55,139
I don't admire anyone but you.

178
00:08:55,759 --> 00:08:56,460
Admire me for what?

179
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,019
The other day Fanzhu gave me

180
00:08:58,039 --> 00:08:58,799
two herbal sachets.

181
00:08:59,740 --> 00:09:01,919
The mosquito-repellent one? All bugs gone.

182
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:03,879
The calming one? I was out like a light.

183
00:09:04,580 --> 00:09:06,039
Now my third aunt, my old aunties,

184
00:09:06,039 --> 00:09:06,740
my fourth auntie,

185
00:09:07,000 --> 00:09:08,100
fourth uncle, fifth aunt, sixth auntie,

186
00:09:08,299 --> 00:09:09,200
they're all asking me for one.

187
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:11,220
Do me a favor, one for each of them.

188
00:09:11,779 --> 00:09:12,940
If you want herbal sachets,

189
00:09:13,019 --> 00:09:14,519
go buy them from my uncle at the market.

190
00:09:15,759 --> 00:09:17,519
I'm here to talk business with you.

191
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:18,379
Think about it, I've got

192
00:09:18,379 --> 00:09:19,659
such a huge pool of potential customers.

193
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:20,679
Just make me

194
00:09:20,700 --> 00:09:21,740
a hundred or so of them.

195
00:09:21,820 --> 00:09:22,559
I'll sell them for you.

196
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,940
Now I get it.

197
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,840
So that time you got stung by bees,

198
00:09:27,340 --> 00:09:28,419
this is what you were after.

199
00:09:29,139 --> 00:09:31,159
I really see potential in this business.

200
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:32,840
Your herbal sachets work so well,

201
00:09:32,899 --> 00:09:34,179
so let me be your Sales Director.

202
00:09:34,659 --> 00:09:35,220
But why on earth

203
00:09:35,220 --> 00:09:36,139
would I partner with you?

204
00:09:36,299 --> 00:09:37,679
Why wouldn't you partner with me?

205
00:09:38,759 --> 00:09:39,519
In three days I can

206
00:09:39,519 --> 00:09:40,379
sell a hundred for you.

207
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:43,899
How about it?

208
00:09:44,700 --> 00:09:45,600
Think it over carefully.

209
00:09:46,919 --> 00:09:47,419
If nothing else,

210
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:48,159
these hundred sachets

211
00:09:48,559 --> 00:09:50,799
are my gift to kick off our partnership.

212
00:09:51,500 --> 00:09:52,620
Once I actually sell them,

213
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,860
you can decide after seeing what I can do.

214
00:09:56,039 --> 00:09:57,399
Fine, let your results do the talking.

215
00:09:58,940 --> 00:09:59,779
Let me scan the code and place an order first.

216
00:09:59,779 --> 00:10:00,440
How did he

217
00:10:00,500 --> 00:10:01,299
end up with Xiaofang?

218
00:10:01,820 --> 00:10:03,240
Young folks and their love lives.

219
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:04,039
Hard to say.

220
00:10:04,080 --> 00:10:05,080
Coming and going all the time.

221
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,639
Being young is just wonderful.

222
00:10:11,740 --> 00:10:12,379
Lao Qi

223
00:10:12,759 --> 00:10:14,379
The Yangs sure have had a lot to celebrate lately

224
00:10:14,779 --> 00:10:16,720
Niece having a baby, aunt getting married

225
00:10:18,500 --> 00:10:19,720
The Yang family's really something

226
00:10:20,059 --> 00:10:20,580
You bet

227
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,000
But Xiaofang's the most impressive of all

228
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,500
She has a kid whenever she wants

229
00:10:23,580 --> 00:10:24,500
Weans it off whenever she wants

230
00:10:24,740 --> 00:10:25,879
Calls all her own shots

231
00:10:25,919 --> 00:10:26,379
True

232
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,019
Lately, you know

233
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:30,000
she's been getting real close with Shu Qingcang

234
00:10:30,279 --> 00:10:32,080
Heard the two of them started a business together

235
00:10:32,320 --> 00:10:32,659
Yeah

236
00:10:32,659 --> 00:10:33,860
That guy looks familiar

237
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:34,500
Before, you know

238
00:10:34,500 --> 00:10:35,500
he was hanging around Xiaofang's place

239
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:36,500
Right, right, selling herbs

240
00:10:36,519 --> 00:10:37,539
And now they're an item

241
00:10:37,899 --> 00:10:38,539
Lao Qi

242
00:10:39,059 --> 00:10:39,879
At this rate

243
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,659
that kid's gonna have

244
00:10:41,679 --> 00:10:42,919
nothing to do with your family anymore

245
00:10:43,139 --> 00:10:44,740
It's a first around here

246
00:10:44,899 --> 00:10:46,299
a kid taking the mother's family name

247
00:10:48,179 --> 00:10:49,500
Let the Yangs run their mouths for now

248
00:10:49,919 --> 00:10:50,440
In a couple of days

249
00:10:51,039 --> 00:10:52,139
that name's getting changed back to mine

250
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:54,720
Aren't you a tough talker

251
00:10:55,019 --> 00:10:55,960
What's wrong with your eyes?

252
00:10:56,399 --> 00:10:57,500
Got too much inner heat?

253
00:11:03,779 --> 00:11:04,440
You're back.

254
00:11:05,799 --> 00:11:06,500
What are you doing?

255
00:11:06,759 --> 00:11:07,480
Holding court?

256
00:11:08,679 --> 00:11:09,039
Yes.

257
00:11:10,379 --> 00:11:11,960
I'm ready to take this to court.

258
00:11:12,940 --> 00:11:13,580
Do you have any idea

259
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,100
what Yang Xiaofang's

260
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:17,019
been up to these past few days?

261
00:11:17,740 --> 00:11:19,120
Busy selling herbal sachets.

262
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:20,440
Busy taking care of Bite.

263
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:21,360
Right.

264
00:11:21,740 --> 00:11:23,200
She really is selling herbal sachets.

265
00:11:23,659 --> 00:11:25,080
But things took a turn along the way.

266
00:11:25,519 --> 00:11:27,059
Yang Xiaofang's out there with another man,

267
00:11:27,399 --> 00:11:28,840
selling herbal sachets together.

268
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:31,799
What man? Who?

269
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:33,000
Shu Qingcang.

270
00:11:35,500 --> 00:11:36,419
I thought it was someone serious.

271
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,159
It's that leech again,

272
00:11:38,299 --> 00:11:39,440
clinging to Xiaofang, right?

273
00:11:40,100 --> 00:11:41,059
You're really underestimating him.

274
00:11:41,899 --> 00:11:42,340
Stop right there!

275
00:11:43,600 --> 00:11:44,519
Shu Qingcang,

276
00:11:45,639 --> 00:11:47,100
under the guise of selling sachets,

277
00:11:47,320 --> 00:11:48,620
is getting cozy with Xiaofang!

278
00:11:48,980 --> 00:11:49,740
And look at you.

279
00:11:49,740 --> 00:11:50,679
What have you been busy with?

280
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:51,840
Well, great job.

281
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,620
Your wife's run off with another man for good.

282
00:11:54,139 --> 00:11:54,899
No way.

283
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,860
Sure, he sells Xiaofang's products,

284
00:11:57,919 --> 00:11:58,580
but you know,

285
00:11:58,600 --> 00:11:59,740
