Well, you're the one who made me clumsy.

858
00:31:59,500 --> 00:32:01,160
So I gave birth to a clumsy girl, huh?

859
00:32:01,460 --> 00:32:02,880
Guess I made a clumsy little girl then.

860
00:32:03,220 --> 00:32:04,099
I won't eat it, you have it.

861
00:32:05,740 --> 00:32:06,940
Why is your hair such a mess?

862
00:32:07,299 --> 00:32:08,240
Can't help it.

863
00:32:08,700 --> 00:32:09,900
What do you mean you can't help it?

864
00:32:09,940 --> 00:32:11,140
You didn't comb your hair this morning again.

865
00:32:11,619 --> 00:32:12,960
You can just tie it up for me, right?

866
00:32:14,819 --> 00:32:16,420
And what if Mom's not around?

867
00:32:16,619 --> 00:32:17,039
What then?

868
00:32:17,220 --> 00:32:17,839
Who'll tie it up for you?

869
00:32:18,019 --> 00:32:19,579
Then... then it'll just be all messy.

870
00:32:20,359 --> 00:32:20,980
Wild child.

871
00:32:22,900 --> 00:32:23,500
Xiaofang.

872
00:32:25,200 --> 00:32:26,819
Mom has to go away for a while.

873
00:32:27,940 --> 00:32:28,799
You have to take good care of yourself.

874
00:32:28,819 --> 00:32:29,319
Okay?

875
00:32:32,240 --> 00:32:33,380
I've set aside some money for you.

876
00:32:34,180 --> 00:32:35,759
Buy whatever you want.

877
00:32:35,859 --> 00:32:36,400
You hear me?

878
00:33:18,900 --> 00:33:19,960
Why bring her up all of a sudden?

879
00:33:21,859 --> 00:33:22,640
After all these years.

880
00:33:27,539 --> 00:33:28,720
It's not that I miss her.

881
00:33:30,240 --> 00:33:31,599
I just suddenly got worried

882
00:33:31,740 --> 00:33:33,500
that Bite, just like me as a kid,

883
00:33:34,960 --> 00:33:37,039
has too many nasty voices around her.

884
00:33:40,099 --> 00:33:41,279
After my dad's accident,

885
00:33:41,420 --> 00:33:42,700
my mom just wanted to leave.

886
00:33:43,519 --> 00:33:45,099
Fine, that was her choice.

887
00:33:46,819 --> 00:33:48,039
But the moment she looked back,

888
00:33:48,039 --> 00:33:49,460
wanting to show me even a little kindness,

889
00:33:49,460 --> 00:33:51,180
if I refused, then it became my fault.

890
00:33:53,940 --> 00:33:54,740
Mom was wrong.

891
00:33:55,400 --> 00:33:57,240
Once you leave, don't come back.

892
00:34:00,759 --> 00:34:02,500
I already told you, I don't need your help.

893
00:34:33,519 --> 00:34:34,480
It's not your fault.

894
00:34:36,579 --> 00:34:38,559
My dad going after

895
00:34:38,559 --> 00:34:39,400
that headcount compensation,

896
00:34:39,400 --> 00:34:40,260
that's not your fault either.

897
00:34:41,400 --> 00:34:42,880
He just

898
00:34:43,219 --> 00:34:44,440
got sick as a kid

899
00:34:44,599 --> 00:34:46,780
and it fried his brain.

900
00:34:48,599 --> 00:34:49,380
It's got nothing to do with you.

901
00:34:56,360 --> 00:34:57,500
Of course it's not my fault.

902
00:34:59,380 --> 00:35:00,940
But whether it's that thing with my mom,

903
00:35:01,320 --> 00:35:02,460
or your dad going to get

904
00:35:02,460 --> 00:35:03,460
Bite's birth registration,

905
00:35:04,000 --> 00:35:05,519
there'll always be people talking behind our backs.

906
00:35:05,920 --> 00:35:07,179
I used to not care about that.

907
00:35:07,199 --> 00:35:08,119
But when it comes to Bite,

908
00:35:08,699 --> 00:35:09,519
I do care.

909
00:35:12,900 --> 00:35:14,019
Whether it's you or Bite,

910
00:35:14,900 --> 00:35:15,940
I'll take good care of both of you.

911
00:35:21,360 --> 00:35:22,659
I'll take good care of Bite too.

912
00:35:33,519 --> 00:35:34,699
What about Bite,

913
00:35:36,780 --> 00:35:38,179
how's she gonna turn out?

914
00:35:39,880 --> 00:35:41,420
If she ever hears all this,

915
00:35:43,139 --> 00:35:45,260
will she cry,

916
00:35:46,599 --> 00:35:48,619
or fire it right back like you do?

917
00:35:51,760 --> 00:35:52,739
She definitely

918
00:35:54,280 --> 00:35:54,920
won't care.

919
00:36:27,960 --> 00:36:28,519
What are you doing?

920
00:36:29,780 --> 00:36:30,599
Having fun, are you?

921
00:36:31,079 --> 00:36:32,199
Yesterday at the police station,

922
00:36:32,199 --> 00:36:33,380
you still weren't embarrassed enough?

923
00:36:33,539 --> 00:36:34,639
Want me to play along with you?

924
00:36:38,019 --> 00:36:38,380
Huzi.

925
00:36:39,199 --> 00:36:40,159
I don't think it's embarrassing.

926
00:36:40,400 --> 00:36:41,300
For my granddaughter,

927
00:36:41,539 --> 00:36:42,539
nothing I do is embarrassing.

928
00:36:43,079 --> 00:36:43,460
Look at me.

929
00:36:43,940 --> 00:36:44,820
I just changed into these clothes.

930
00:36:44,860 --> 00:36:45,760
Washed spotlessly clean.

931
00:36:46,159 --> 00:36:47,099
The handkerchief's brand new.

932
00:36:47,519 --> 00:36:48,579
My hands are freshly washed too.

933
00:36:49,179 --> 00:36:50,280
Now I can hold my granddaughter, right?

934
00:36:54,719 --> 00:36:55,579
The grasshopper stays.

935
00:36:56,019 --> 00:36:56,579
You leave.

936
00:36:57,559 --> 00:36:57,960
Huzi.

937
00:36:59,659 --> 00:37:00,699
Fine, fine, fine, alright.

938
00:37:00,820 --> 00:37:01,639
Go, go, go.

939
00:37:02,460 --> 00:37:04,940
Xiaofang decides who holds the baby.

940
00:37:05,079 --> 00:37:06,320
So give it up already.

941
00:37:21,219 --> 00:37:21,519
Dad.

942
00:37:21,519 --> 00:37:22,199
What are you doing here?

943
00:37:23,260 --> 00:37:24,360
It's been raining a lot lately, right?

944
00:37:24,380 --> 00:37:25,460
Look how good this mountain spring water is.

945
00:37:25,619 --> 00:37:26,440
I'll take some back to brew medicine.

946
00:37:28,980 --> 00:37:30,760
You've been making a lot of those lately.

947
00:37:30,760 --> 00:37:31,699
Those herbal sachets.

948
00:37:33,719 --> 00:37:35,360
I've got a new idea.

949
00:37:35,599 --> 00:37:36,619
I want to test the waters.

950
00:37:37,780 --> 00:37:38,780
Got it.

951
00:37:39,440 --> 00:37:40,119
I support you.

952
00:37:47,519 --> 00:37:49,440
Little Bite's residency.

953
00:37:49,440 --> 00:37:50,719
When did you register her?

954
00:37:51,920 --> 00:37:53,300
The first day after confinement.

955
00:37:53,900 --> 00:37:54,420
Not bad.

956
00:37:55,159 --> 00:37:56,699
Usually so unreliable,

957
00:37:57,800 --> 00:37:59,300
but you come through when it counts.

958
00:37:59,539 --> 00:38:00,860
I never mess around on big things.

959
00:38:01,019 --> 00:38:01,539
What?

960
00:38:02,320 --> 00:38:04,219
I never mess around on big things.

961
00:38:06,659 --> 00:38:07,539
Look,

962
00:38:08,239 --> 00:38:10,019
better to stay away from the Qi family.

963
00:38:10,380 --> 00:38:11,519
That family's pretty shady.

964
00:38:13,239 --> 00:38:14,300
Just a couple days ago,

965
00:38:14,320 --> 00:38:15,719
Xiaowei's mom came to see me.

966
00:38:16,920 --> 00:38:17,900
That Bie person came.

967
00:38:18,639 --> 00:38:19,539
Her name's Bie.

968
00:38:20,480 --> 00:38:21,639
She came to apologize to me.

969
00:38:26,800 --> 00:38:28,199
Auntie, is your back hurting again?

970
00:38:29,400 --> 00:38:30,039
Oh, Xiaofang.

971
00:38:30,840 --> 00:38:32,900
I was swinging it side to side,

972
00:38:33,039 --> 00:38:34,039
to clear the heart fire, you know?

973
00:38:35,000 --> 00:38:35,960
And I overdid it.

974
00:38:36,179 --> 00:38:38,099
I just picked some Thousand-Jin Pull today.

975
00:38:38,260 --> 00:38:40,019
Boiled as tea, it can promote blood circulation and remove stasis.

976
00:38:40,679 --> 00:38:41,559
It's perfect for you.

977
00:38:42,199 --> 00:38:42,920
Thank you, Xiaofang.

978
00:38:43,719 --> 00:38:44,239
Xiaofang.

979
00:38:45,699 --> 00:38:46,219
What is it?

980
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:49,760
I was just about to come find you.

981
00:38:53,079 --> 00:38:54,340
I did something foolish.

982
00:38:56,000 --> 00:38:56,659
Xiaowei's dad,

983
00:38:57,420 --> 00:38:58,980
he insisted I go get that,

984
00:38:59,039 --> 00:39:00,360
Bite's birth certificate.

985
00:39:00,579 --> 00:39:02,440
And I took a few strands of her baby hair too.

986
00:39:03,260 --> 00:39:04,699
He said it's for a paternity test.

987
00:39:04,719 --> 00:39:05,820
So we could register her,

988
00:39:05,820 --> 00:39:06,679
under our family.

989
00:39:07,000 --> 00:39:09,159
He said if you want the child,

990
00:39:09,380 --> 00:39:10,760
you'd have to marry Xiaowei.

991
00:39:13,579 --> 00:39:14,840
I truly hope,

992
00:39:14,840 --> 00:39:16,019
that you and Xiaowei work out.

993
00:39:17,619 --> 00:39:18,639
But this whole thing,

994
00:39:19,420 --> 00:39:20,579
Auntie was wrong to do it.

995
00:39:25,219 --> 00:39:26,320
It's okay, Auntie.

996
00:39:26,539 --> 00:39:27,320
I know what's going on.

997
00:39:31,420 --> 00:39:32,280
Looking at it this way,

998
00:39:32,340 --> 00:39:34,239
Bie Qiumei still has some conscience.

999
00:39:35,219 --> 00:39:36,980
But that Lao Qi,

1000
00:39:37,000 --> 00:39:38,340
that Qi Deyao...

1001
00:39:40,960 --> 00:39:41,360
Dad.

1002
00:39:43,380 --> 00:39:44,920
Qi Deyao wants to see me.

1003
00:39:54,619 --> 00:39:55,639
Getting old, I'm getting old.

1004
00:39:55,780 --> 00:39:56,500
Doing a bit of work

1005
00:39:57,119 --> 00:39:58,639
and my back aches, my head spins.

1006
00:40:00,260 --> 00:40:01,000
Uncle Qi.

1007
00:40:01,239 --> 00:40:01,820
Working hard, huh.

1008
00:40:02,039 --> 00:40:03,239
Yeah, I can see it's tough for you.

1009
00:40:04,960 --> 00:40:05,840
This work is usually

1010
00:40:05,840 --> 00:40:06,739
done by Auntie, right?

1011
00:40:07,139 --> 00:40:08,260
Auntie really does have it rough.

1012
00:40:08,820 --> 00:40:10,099
She just hands me the dustpan.

1013
00:40:10,860 --> 00:40:11,219
Look at this.

1014
00:40:11,739 --> 00:40:13,199
This whole patch of golden grains,

1015
00:40:13,380 --> 00:40:14,820
every one soaked with my sweat.

1016
00:40:15,360 --> 00:40:16,860
Then your meals must be pretty salty.

1017
00:40:17,139 --> 00:40:17,860
Aren't you a comedian.

1018
00:40:17,860 --> 00:40:18,760
Uncle, whatever it is,

1019
00:40:18,760 --> 00:40:19,679
just tell me straight.

1020
00:40:20,260 --> 00:40:20,639
Okay, okay, okay.

1021
00:40:21,440 --> 00:40:22,000
Come here, Xiaofang.

1022
00:40:22,199 --> 00:40:22,960
A word with you, over here.

1023
00:40:22,980 --> 00:40:23,500
This way, this way.

1024
00:40:26,099 --> 00:40:26,420
Here.

1025
00:40:27,199 --> 00:40:28,059
I bought you some milk tea.

1026
00:40:28,460 --> 00:40:29,340
I waited in line for ages.

1027
00:40:29,400 --> 00:40:30,019
Take it, take it.

1028
00:40:30,059 --> 00:40:30,940
Go on, take it.

1029
00:40:33,159 --> 00:40:33,559
Xiaofang.

1030
00:40:34,940 --> 00:40:35,559
That business with the birth registration,

1031
00:40:36,920 --> 00:40:37,900
I did it all on my own.

1032
00:40:38,699 --> 00:40:39,699
And now I'm being punished for it.

1033
00:40:40,840 --> 00:40:41,659
Xiaowei won't speak to me.

1034
00:40:41,860 --> 00:40:42,599
Qiu Mei blames me.

1035
00:40:43,079 --> 00:40:44,039
I'm the one to blame.

1036
00:40:44,719 --> 00:40:45,460
If you want to be angry, be angry at me.

1037
00:40:45,840 --> 00:40:46,440
Just please,

1038
00:40:46,800 --> 00:40:47,980
don't stop Xiaowei and Qiu Mei

1039
00:40:48,500 --> 00:40:49,659
from going to see Bite.

1040
00:40:51,980 --> 00:40:52,500
Don't, Uncle.

1041
00:40:52,500 --> 00:40:53,480
Uncle, Uncle, don't be like this.

1042
00:40:53,960 --> 00:40:54,579
People will think I've done

1043
00:40:54,579 --> 00:40:55,320
something terrible to you.

1044
00:40:55,780 --> 00:40:56,440
Please don't do this.

1045
00:40:56,840 --> 00:40:57,500
Of course not.

1046
00:40:58,139 --> 00:40:59,099
You've done nothing at all.

1047
00:40:59,880 --> 00:41:00,719
You brought Bite

1048
00:41:00,900 --> 00:41:01,599
into our family.

1049
00:41:01,760 --> 00:41:02,679
You're a real hero.

1050
00:41:03,260 --> 00:41:03,719
Xiaofang.

1051
00:41:04,420 --> 00:41:06,019
Uncle was completely in the wrong before.

1052
00:41:06,579 --> 00:41:07,679
Over this whole thing,

1053
00:41:07,860 --> 00:41:09,400
I'm kicking myself.

1054
00:41:10,179 --> 00:41:12,119
But I truly care about the child.

1055
00:41:12,840 --> 00:41:13,679
Our family's situation,

1056
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:15,239
after all, is just a tiny bit

1057
00:41:16,119 --> 00:41:17,699
better off than yours.

1058
00:41:18,559 --> 00:41:19,739
But whatever I have,

1059
00:41:20,420 --> 00:41:21,380
I'll give it all to the child.

1060
00:41:21,760 --> 00:41:22,679
After all, she's my one and only

1061
00:41:22,679 --> 00:41:23,500
eldest granddaughter.

1062
00:41:24,099 --> 00:41:24,760
Come on, come on, come on.

1063
00:41:27,739 --> 00:41:29,039
Like I said before, Uncle,

1064
00:41:30,739 --> 00:41:32,099
as long as you don't hurt Bite,

1065
00:41:32,420 --> 00:41:33,880
I've got no problem with you visiting her.

1066
00:41:35,679 --> 00:41:37,699
You... you'll let me see Bite?

1067
00:41:39,960 --> 00:41:40,380
Qi,

1068
00:41:41,139 --> 00:41:42,440
talk to your daughter-in-law.

1069
00:41:42,880 --> 00:41:43,960
Why's he crying all of a sudden?

1070
00:41:45,739 --> 00:41:46,280
Yang Xiaofang,

1071
00:41:46,559 --> 00:41:47,000
you know,

1072
00:41:47,659 --> 00:41:49,260
the registration thing fell through, right?

1073
00:41:49,719 --> 00:41:50,780
Why won't you let it go?

1074
00:41:50,920 --> 00:41:51,659
Is it really necessary?

1075
00:41:51,760 --> 00:41:53,000
Lao Xu, what nonsense are you spouting?

1076
00:41:53,239 --> 00:41:53,820
It's got nothing to do with the kid.

1077
00:41:53,820 --> 00:41:54,960
I'm apologizing to Xiaofang.

1078
00:41:55,300 --> 00:41:55,880
Get lost.

1079
00:41:56,159 --> 00:41:56,820
Young people

1080
00:41:57,159 --> 00:41:57,980
can be so ruthless,

1081
00:41:58,179 --> 00:41:59,239
pushing an old man to this point.

1082
00:42:00,019 --> 00:42:00,559
What's that phrase again?

1083
00:42:01,079 --> 00:42:01,900
That's enough, isn't it.

1084
00:42:02,559 --> 00:42:04,059
What nonsense are you on about, you old bear?

1085
00:42:04,199 --> 00:42:05,159
You're the one who should knock it off.

1086
00:42:05,260 --> 00:42:05,800
Get out of here.

1087
00:42:06,239 --> 00:42:07,179
This, this, this...

1088
00:42:07,400 --> 00:42:08,099
Scratch that line.

1089
00:42:08,139 --> 00:42:08,780
I'll transfer you a hundred.

1090
00:42:09,360 --> 00:42:10,000
Okay, okay, okay.

1091
00:42:10,119 --> 00:42:10,820
I'll say lines too.

1092
00:42:10,880 --> 00:42:11,420
I'll give you fifty.

1093
00:42:11,420 --> 00:42:11,960
Lao Qi.

1094
00:42:13,340 --> 00:42:14,559
Alright, everyone, back to work.

1095
00:42:15,260 --> 00:42:16,219
Stop standing around gawking.

1096
00:42:16,780 --> 00:42:17,559
They don't have a clue.

1097
00:42:18,460 --> 00:42:19,739
Ran into a bunch of lunatics.

1098
00:42:22,599 --> 00:42:22,980
Xiaofang.

1099
00:42:23,320 --> 00:42:23,760
No, he...

1100
00:42:24,039 --> 00:42:24,860
Uncle, this guy's head is...

1101
00:42:25,159 --> 00:42:26,119
I think you're right.

1102
00:42:26,440 --> 00:42:27,380
As for the registration thing,

1103
00:42:27,420 --> 00:42:28,579
it really is time to turn the page.

1104
00:42:29,320 --> 00:42:30,579
The way you just poured your heart out

1105
00:42:30,599 --> 00:42:31,739
and told me all of that,

1106
00:42:32,119 --> 00:42:33,039
it really touched me.

1107
00:42:33,699 --> 00:42:34,639
Every word was the honest truth.

1108
00:42:36,000 --> 00:42:36,519
Xiaofang,

1109
00:42:37,639 --> 00:42:38,760
if you feel that way,

1110
00:42:39,380 --> 00:42:40,980
then why don't we truly

1111
00:42:41,280 --> 00:42:42,039
become one family again.

1112
00:42:43,239 --> 00:42:45,179
Let's just have both families sit down,

1113
00:42:45,239 --> 00:42:46,199
make it a lively affair,

1114
00:42:46,199 --> 00:42:47,659
and throw Bite a full moon celebration.

1115
00:42:48,119 --> 00:42:48,920
The old misunderstandings

1116
00:42:48,980 --> 00:42:50,340
can all be cleared up over the meal.

1117
00:42:50,900 --> 00:42:51,300
Xiaofang,

1118
00:42:51,320 --> 00:42:52,519
that's a wonderful idea.

1119
00:42:53,420 --> 00:42:54,019
Leave it to me,

1120
00:42:54,260 --> 00:42:54,860
I'll take care of everything.

1121
00:42:54,980 --> 00:42:56,079
I'll cover all the costs.

1122
00:42:56,380 --> 00:42:56,980
I'll make sure it's

1123
00:42:57,679 --> 00:42:58,820
high-end, classy, and top-notch.

1124
00:42:59,079 --> 00:43:00,219
So the whole village knows

1125
00:43:00,219 --> 00:43:01,059
how precious Bite is.

1126
00:43:01,639 --> 00:43:02,000
No.

1127
00:43:03,280 --> 00:43:05,260
Everyone who's here today,

1128
00:43:05,760 --> 00:43:06,980
including all the neighbors,

1129
00:43:06,980 --> 00:43:07,860
we'll invite them all.

1130
00:43:08,119 --> 00:43:09,199
We'll throw the biggest bash ever

1131
00:43:09,500 --> 00:43:10,780
and win back all the face

1132
